{"pageid":1146,"title":"Badges","displaytitle":"<span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Badges</span>","revid":21136,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p><b>Badges</b> or <b>Achievements</b>, are accomplishments that the player can obtain in-game. There are a total of 31 achievements that are currently obtainable.\n</p>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Obtainable_Badges\">Obtainable Badges</span></h2>\n<table class=\"fandom-table\" style=\"text-align:center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Badges\n</th>\n<th>Description\n</th>\n<th>Obtaining\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://www.roblox.com/badges/2129481339/Average-Oaklands-Enjoyer\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"Average Oaklands Enjoyer Badge\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/a/a2/Average_Oaklands_Enjoyer_Badge.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/160?cb=20230718130331\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"160\" height=\"160\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Average Oaklands Enjoyer Badge.png\" data-image-key=\"Average_Oaklands_Enjoyer_Badge.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span>\n<p style=\"font-size:12px\">Average Oaklands Enjoyer</p>\n</td>\n<td>Thank you for deciding to play Oaklands. Like, you could’ve spent your time on something else, but you decided to play OUR game, even if it was just for a few seconds.\n</td>\n<td>Join the game for the first time.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://www.roblox.com/badges/2129537559/Alpha-Player\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"Alpha Player Badge\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/c/cb/Alpha_Player_Badge.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/160?cb=20230718130216\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"160\" height=\"160\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Alpha Player Badge.png\" data-image-key=\"Alpha_Player_Badge.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span>\n<p style=\"font-size:12px\">Alpha Player</p>\n</td>\n<td>Thank you for playing Oaklands during its alpha phase!\n</td>\n<td>Play Oaklands during the alpha phase.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://www.roblox.com/badges/2129553249/Superfan\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"Superfan Badge\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/8/83/Superfan_Badge.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/160?cb=20230718130217\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"160\" height=\"160\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Superfan Badge.png\" data-image-key=\"Superfan_Badge.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span>\n<p style=\"font-size:12px\">Superfan</p>\n</td>\n<td>No autographs, please!\n</td>\n<td>Be in a server with a developer.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://www.roblox.com/badges/2129553252/A-Familiar-Place\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"A Familiar Place Badge\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"160\" height=\"160\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"A Familiar Place Badge.png\" data-image-key=\"A_Familiar_Place_Badge.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/b/b0/A_Familiar_Place_Badge.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/160?cb=20230718130217\" /></a></span>\n<p style=\"font-size:12px\">⬟ A Familiar Place</p>\n</td>\n<td>It gives off a sense of.. nostalgia.\n</td>\n<td>Find the <a href=\"/wiki/Secret_Shack\" title=\"Secret Shack\">Secret Shack</a>.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://www.roblox.com/badges/2129568405/Fresh-Start\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"Fresh Start Badge\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"160\" height=\"160\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Fresh Start Badge.png\" data-image-key=\"Fresh_Start_Badge.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/2/20/Fresh_Start_Badge.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/160?cb=20230718130217\" /></a></span>\n<p style=\"font-size:12px\">Fresh Start</p>\n</td>\n<td>Now, what do you plan on doing next?\n</td>\n<td>Create a new save slot.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://www.roblox.com/badges/2129579450/Amateur-Woodworker\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"Amateur Woodworker Badge\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"160\" height=\"160\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Amateur Woodworker Badge.png\" data-image-key=\"Amateur_Woodworker_Badge.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/7/76/Amateur_Woodworker_Badge.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/160?cb=20230718130217\" /></a></span>\n<p style=\"font-size:12px\">Amateur Woodworker</p>\n</td>\n<td>Sometimes, just one type of wood isn’t enough.\n</td>\n<td>Mill one of each tree type.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://www.roblox.com/badges/2129579451/Amateur-Geologist\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"Amateur Geologist Badge\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"160\" height=\"160\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Amateur Geologist Badge.png\" data-image-key=\"Amateur_Geologist_Badge.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/0/03/Amateur_Geologist_Badge.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/160?cb=20230718130217\" /></a></span>\n<p style=\"font-size:12px\">Amateur Geologist</p>\n</td>\n<td>I mean, they’re very pretty, so I don’t blame you.\n</td>\n<td>Refine / Forge one of each ore type.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://www.roblox.com/badges/2129579453/Wholesaler\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"Wholesaler Badge\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"160\" height=\"160\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Wholesaler Badge.png\" data-image-key=\"Wholesaler_Badge.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/7/71/Wholesaler_Badge.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/160?cb=20230718130217\" /></a></span>\n<p style=\"font-size:12px\">Wholesaler</p>\n</td>\n<td>That's a lot of bread.\n</td>\n<td>Sell over $25,000 at once.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://www.roblox.com/badges/2129579456/Burning-Doorway\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"Burning Doorway Badge\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"160\" height=\"160\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Burning Doorway Badge.png\" data-image-key=\"Burning_Doorway_Badge.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/5/57/Burning_Doorway_Badge.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/160?cb=20230923205834\" /></a></span>\n<p style=\"font-size:12px\">Burning Doorway</p>\n</td>\n<td>Through the gates of hell.\n</td>\n<td>Complete the <a href=\"/wiki/Emberbane\" title=\"Emberbane\">Emberbane</a> puzzle.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://www.roblox.com/badges/2129579458/Time-to-Expand\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"Time to Expand Badge\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"160\" height=\"160\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Time to Expand Badge.png\" data-image-key=\"Time_to_Expand_Badge.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/e/e2/Time_to_Expand_Badge.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/160?cb=20230718130217\" /></a></span>\n<p style=\"font-size:12px\">Time to Expand!</p>\n</td>\n<td>I guess you ran out of room on that small property.\n</td>\n<td>Expand your plot.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://www.roblox.com/badges/2129596370/Greedy-Land-Buyer\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"Greedy Land Buyer Badge\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"160\" height=\"160\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Greedy Land Buyer Badge.png\" data-image-key=\"Greedy_Land_Buyer_Badge.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/3/3f/Greedy_Land_Buyer_Badge.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/160?cb=20230718130217\" /></a></span>\n<p style=\"font-size:12px\">Greedy Land Buyer</p>\n</td>\n<td>All your land are now belong to me.\n</td>\n<td>Expand your Property to the max\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://www.roblox.com/badges/2129596373/Shoplifter\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"Shoplifter Badge\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"160\" height=\"160\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Shoplifter Badge.png\" data-image-key=\"Shoplifter_Badge.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/9/9b/Shoplifter_Badge.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/160?cb=20230718130217\" /></a></span>\n<p style=\"font-size:12px\">Shoplifter</p>\n</td>\n<td>I mean.. it was a worth a shot, I guess?\n</td>\n<td>Bring an item out of a store without paying for it.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://www.roblox.com/badges/2129596374/Adventurer\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"Adventurer Badge\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"160\" height=\"160\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Adventurer Badge.png\" data-image-key=\"Adventurer_Badge.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/4/4f/Adventurer_Badge.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/160?cb=20230718130217\" /></a></span>\n<p style=\"font-size:12px\">Adventurer</p>\n</td>\n<td>Maybe you’ll find a few secrets along the way.\n</td>\n<td>Visit all the current landmarks and regions on the map.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://www.roblox.com/badges/1665995437512298/Blossom-Gates\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"Blossom Gates Badge\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"160\" height=\"160\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Blossom Gates Badge.png\" data-image-key=\"Blossom_Gates_Badge.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/9/97/Blossom_Gates_Badge.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/160?cb=20240419222142\" /></a></span>\n<p style=\"font-size:12px\">Blossom Gates</p>\n</td>\n<td>Only granted to the ones who can complete an ultimate quest\n</td>\n<td>Obtain <a href=\"/wiki/Petalfall\" title=\"Petalfall\">Petalfall</a>.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://www.roblox.com/badges/1652075655609193/Spring-2024\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"Spring 2024 Badge\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"160\" height=\"160\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Spring 2024 Badge.png\" data-image-key=\"Spring_2024_Badge.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/7/7d/Spring_2024_Badge.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/160?cb=20240419222342\" /></a></span>\n<p style=\"font-size:12px\">Spring 2024</p>\n</td>\n<td>Thank you for playing this years Oaklands spring update! 🌸\n</td>\n<td>Play during Spring Event 2024.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><figure class=\"thumb mw-halign-center show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 150px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/0/0f/Tehepikduckbadge.png/revision/latest?cb=20251226170542\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Teh epik duck\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Tehepikduckbadge.png\" data-image-key=\"Tehepikduckbadge.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/0/0f/Tehepikduckbadge.png/revision/latest?cb=20251226170542\" /></a> \t<noscript><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/0/0f/Tehepikduckbadge.png/revision/latest?cb=20251226170542\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Teh epik duck\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/0/0f/Tehepikduckbadge.png/revision/latest?cb=20251226170542\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"T